# guard-uncertainty — `uncertainty` is a declared, ordered token property (§4),
# orthogonal to `risk`: both tokens here are risk low, and only the one resting
# on a contested basis is referred to a human.
actor  bot7
human  alice  role review
gate   open   risk low  grant bot7
gate   firm   risk low  grant bot7
reserve claim by review when uncertainty >= contested
cord bot7 -> open
cord bot7 -> firm
cord open -> master
cord firm -> master
